    {
      "id": 167,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -1130,
        6550
      ],
      "size": [
        900,
        300
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Writer → Refiner on one local backend\n\nOne **H3 LLM Backend** (`ollama:qwen3:8b`) feeds both the **H3 Claude Code Writer** and the **H3 Claude Code Refiner** through their `llm` sockets. The writer drafts the prompt from the context nodes (Time / Scene / Feelings / Cinematic), the refiner revises it with your instruction, and the refined prompt is what the video node renders.\n\n- `session_id` → `session_id`: with a local model the writer keeps a text-only session under ComfyUI's temp folder, so the refiner continues the same conversation (the guide and the draft are already in context) exactly like it does with Claude Code.\n- Swap the backend's `model_name` to anything the router knows (`lmstudio:…`, `local:…`, `claude:…`, `gpt:…`) and both nodes follow.\n- `{vars}` work in every text box: connect an H3 Characters node to a `context_N` socket and write `{character1}`.\n\nBoth previews show the draft and the refined prompt side by side."
      ],
      "color": "#3d3222",
      "bgcolor": "#1e1c17",
      "title": "APNext — LLM Backend"
    },
